  "methods": "## 3.1 Procedure\n\nFirst we set a learning rate of 1e-4, then a batch size of 256, and train 100 epochs.\n\n## 3.2 Setup and data\n\nWe use 8 GPUs with the seed 42 and resize every image to a resolution of 512.\n\n## 3.3 Baseline\n\nCompared with the released checkpoint at the same budget.\n\n## 3.4 Limitations\n\nIt fails when the batch is smaller than 8, because the gradient estimate becomes too noisy.\n\n---\n\n## 数值出处对照\n\n正文共 7 个数字：6 个已对上台账，0 个与台账不符，0 个在材料中找不到，0 个存在但归属未定，1 个按规则不计（年份、图表号、指标名后缀、边界条件等）。\n\n| 段 | 数值 | 参数 | 材料位置 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `1e-4` | learning_rate | material/config.yaml:L2 |\n| 1 | `256` | batch_size | material/config.yaml:L3 |\n| 1 | `100` | epochs | material/README.md:L3 |\n| 2 | `8` | gpus | material/config.yaml:L10 |\n| 2 | `42` | seed | material/config.yaml:L9 |\n| 2 | `512` | image_size | material/config.yaml:L6 |\n",
